WHAT NEITHER LICENCE COVERS

  Patient data. No FASTQ, BAM, CRAM, VCF, variant coordinate, genotype or
  sample identifier is present in this repository, and none is licensed here.
  The underlying genomic and clinical data belong to the patient and their
  family, were provided under the terms of the hackathon, and are explicitly
  not for redistribution.

  Third-party data. Records retrieved from ClinVar, Ensembl, the Human
  Phenotype Ontology, gnomAD and AlphaFold keep the terms of their respective
  sources. Model outputs from AlphaGenome are subject to that model's terms.
